{
    "title": "Instabridge: WiFi Hotspot Map",
    "description": "<b>The Wifi Hunt is over! Fast and Secure Public WiFi Hotspot Map at no charge </b>\r\n\r\nWe\u2019ve all been there: you\u2019re in a rush or unsure which place has WiFi and don\u2019t want to go on a WiFi scavenger hunt throughout the city every time you need to connect to WiFi! WiFi Hotspot map from Instabridge is here to save you the hassle of asking for WiFi access everywhere you go. The offline WiFi Hotspot map makes it the perfect travel app, and with a minimalist home screen launcher, WiFi is accessible in just a few taps.\r\n\r\nInstabridge is a worldwide WiFi community of people who share WiFi access. We\u2019ve collected over 20 million WiFi networks and hotspots, and this number is growing every day! It's a WiFi Hotspot map that saves you money on data usage and helps others who can't afford a WiFi connection. The more people who add WiFi, the closer we get to making WiFi accessible for everyone!\r\n\r\n<b>Just download the app with WiFi Hotspot map >> Automatically connect to WiFi >> Join our community</b>\r\n\r\nWith millions of secure, up-to-date WiFi hotspots, Instabridge is the simplest way to connect to Internet. Instabridge's Wifi finder knows which WiFi networks work and automatically keeps you off those that don't. With our beautifully integrated travel map and detailed statistics on every WiFi network in our database, you won\u2019t ever have to worry about how and where you can connect to WiFi. No setup required. It just works!\r\n\r\n<b>Help us make WiFi accessible to everyone! When you join our community, you\u2019re paving the way for the millions of people worldwide who can\u2019t afford WiFi at home. </b>\r\n\r\n<b>Introducing Mobile Data by Instabridge For eSIM-supported phones </b>\r\n\u2022 Global Coverage: 191+ countries, no roaming, no SIM hunting.\r\n\u2022 Hassle-Free: Stay connected effortlessly, no WiFi search.\r\n\u2022 Cost-Effective: Affordable travel data.\r\n\u2022 Easy Activation: Quick eSIM setup.\r\n\u2022 Seamless: All-in-one app for connectivity, anytime, anywhere!\r\n\r\n<b>FEATURES</b>\r\n\u2022 Quick Wifi Access with WiFi Hotspot map: access the nearest WiFi with one tap from the home screen launcher\r\n\u2022 Mobile Data: Global Internet in your pocket\r\n\u2022 Power Search: \r\nGet super quick access to the internet; use Instabridge as your home screen app launcher to power search to access your apps, contacts, and web history from one place.\r\n\u2022 Get Internet connections at no charge in all major cities\r\n\u2022 Data-saving web browser with 10x better compression than the competition\r\n\u2022 No data limitation, no cost\r\n\u2022 Auto-connect to WiFi as soon as it\u2019s available (perfect in airports). Get Internet at no charge automatically!\r\n\u2022 Useful stats (like speed, popularity, and data usage) on any WiFi hotspot in our database.\r\n\u2022 Offline WiFi Hotspot map included so you can find hotspots even when you\u2019re roaming or low on data! \r\n\u2022 Supports WEP, WPA, WPA2 and WPA3\r\n\u2022 Easier to use than WPS\r\n\u2022 Easy-to-use speed tests\r\n\r\n<b>What others are saying about Instabridge:</b>\r\n\"\"Instabridge is a Swedish company that\u2019s invented something so simple, and so awesome, that you\u2019ve got to wonder what took this industry so long!\"\"\r\n<i>Android Authority</i>\r\n\r\n\u201cToday\u2019s application is, simply, exceptional. It's a brilliant idea, an excellent solution and executed perfectly. I'm in love.\u201d\r\n<i>El Android Libre</i>\r\n\r\n\"\"Instabridge is an elegant solution\"\"\r\n<i>Lifehacker</i>\r\n\r\n\"\"A simple interface allows friends to get access without having to type in a convoluted string of numbers and letters from a scrap of paper.\"\"\r\n<i>The Economist</i>\r\n\r\n",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>The Wifi Hunt is over! Fast and Secure Public WiFi Hotspot Map at no charge </b><br><br>We\u2019ve all been there: you\u2019re in a rush or unsure which place has WiFi and don\u2019t want to go on a WiFi scavenger hunt throughout the city every time you need to connect to WiFi! WiFi Hotspot map from Instabridge is here to save you the hassle of asking for WiFi access everywhere you go. The offline WiFi Hotspot map makes it the perfect travel app, and with a minimalist home screen launcher, WiFi is accessible in just a few taps.<br><br>Instabridge is a worldwide WiFi community of people who share WiFi access. We\u2019ve collected over 20 million WiFi networks and hotspots, and this number is growing every day! It&#39;s a WiFi Hotspot map that saves you money on data usage and helps others who can&#39;t afford a WiFi connection. The more people who add WiFi, the closer we get to making WiFi accessible for everyone!<br><br><b>Just download the app with WiFi Hotspot map &gt;&gt; Automatically connect to WiFi &gt;&gt; Join our community</b><br><br>With millions of secure, up-to-date WiFi hotspots, Instabridge is the simplest way to connect to Internet. Instabridge&#39;s Wifi finder knows which WiFi networks work and automatically keeps you off those that don&#39;t. With our beautifully integrated travel map and detailed statistics on every WiFi network in our database, you won\u2019t ever have to worry about how and where you can connect to WiFi. No setup required. It just works!<br><br><b>Help us make WiFi accessible to everyone! When you join our community, you\u2019re paving the way for the millions of people worldwide who can\u2019t afford WiFi at home. </b><br><br><b>Introducing Mobile Data by Instabridge For eSIM-supported phones </b><br>\u2022 Global Coverage: 191+ countries, no roaming, no SIM hunting.<br>\u2022 Hassle-Free: Stay connected effortlessly, no WiFi search.<br>\u2022 Cost-Effective: Affordable travel data.<br>\u2022 Easy Activation: Quick eSIM setup.<br>\u2022 Seamless: All-in-one app for connectivity, anytime, anywhere!<br><br><b>FEATURES</b><br>\u2022 Quick Wifi Access with WiFi Hotspot map: access the nearest WiFi with one tap from the home screen launcher<br>\u2022 Mobile Data: Global Internet in your pocket<br>\u2022 Power Search: <br>Get super quick access to the internet; use Instabridge as your home screen app launcher to power search to access your apps, contacts, and web history from one place.<br>\u2022 Get Internet connections at no charge in all major cities<br>\u2022 Data-saving web browser with 10x better compression than the competition<br>\u2022 No data limitation, no cost<br>\u2022 Auto-connect to WiFi as soon as it\u2019s available (perfect in airports). Get Internet at no charge automatically!<br>\u2022 Useful stats (like speed, popularity, and data usage) on any WiFi hotspot in our database.<br>\u2022 Offline WiFi Hotspot map included so you can find hotspots even when you\u2019re roaming or low on data! <br>\u2022 Supports WEP, WPA, WPA2 and WPA3<br>\u2022 Easier to use than WPS<br>\u2022 Easy-to-use speed tests<br><br><b>What others are saying about Instabridge:</b><br>&quot;&quot;Instabridge is a Swedish company that\u2019s invented something so simple, and so awesome, that you\u2019ve got to wonder what took this industry so long!&quot;&quot;<br><i>Android Authority</i><br><br>\u201cToday\u2019s application is, simply, exceptional. It&#39;s a brilliant idea, an excellent solution and executed perfectly. I&#39;m in love.\u201d<br><i>El Android Libre</i><br><br>&quot;&quot;Instabridge is an elegant solution&quot;&quot;<br><i>Lifehacker</i><br><br>&quot;&quot;A simple interface allows friends to get access without having to type in a convoluted string of numbers and letters from a scrap of paper.&quot;&quot;<br><i>The Economist</i><br><br>",
